  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GRACE Smiles: Dental Hygiene Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By supplying basic dental hygiene items (toothbrush, tooth paste, dental floss, and mouth wash) to the children we service in Thailand, as well are other areas in need, we hope to bring forth a better quality of life to those in need. Dental hygiene kits will be sent around the world to children who may not have adequate dental care available to them.</narrative>
  </description>
